TITLE ANNYOS  |  COMMAND GUIDE
------------------------------------------
ROW COMMAND | DESCRIPTION
ROW DIR | List the current directory
ROW CD [DIR|..|\] | Change directory
ROW CLS | Clear the screen
ROW ECHO <TEXT> | Print a message
ROW MEM | Show memory information
ROW DATE | Show the current date
ROW TIME | Show the current time
ROW COLOR <THEME> | Set BLUE, GREEN, or AMBER
ROW REBOOT | Restart the computer
ROW NAME[.AP] | Run an app in this folder
ROW VER | Show AnnyOS version
ROW HELP | Show this command guide
